{1}{Excuse me...that book is interesting, don't you think?  It seems that these Molochean Hand assassins were part of some larger group called the Derian-Ka?  What did he call them--the Order of the Dead?  Obviously, these fellows all had some sort of disagreement...}{Excuse me...that book is interesting, don't you think?  It seems that these Molochean Hand assassins were part of some larger group called the Derian-Ka?  What did he call them--the Order of the Dead?  Obviously, these fellows all had some sort of disagreement...}{}{1}{}{}
{2}{Yes.  Joachim thinks perhaps they're not all that evil...}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{Uh...sure...uh...}{}{-4}{}{25}{}
{5}{Not all that bad!  Ha!  Obviously Joachim hasn't run into them lately.  [He chuckles.]  That fellow Trellian did sound like an agreeable sort, though, didn't he?  Anyone who chooses to side against something called the Order of the Dead is alright in my book...}{Not all that bad!  Ha!  Obviously Joachim hasn't run into them lately.  [He chuckles.]  That fellow Trellian did sound like an agreeable sort, though, didn't he?  Anyone who chooses to side against something called the Order of the Dead is alright in my book...}{}{2}{}{}
{6}{You mean 'the First ASSASSIN' Trellian?}{}{5}{}{8}{}
{8}{[Virgil laughs.]  Yes, you've got a point there.  I'm sure the man was no saint.  Then again, who really is?  We've all got, uh...blood on our hands.  [He looks pained for a moment.]  In the end, we all just play the roles given us...sometimes they don't fit so well, but I guess we make do...}{[Virgil laughs.]  Yes, you've got a point there.  I'm sure the man was no saint.  Then again, who really is?  We've all got, uh...blood on our hands.  [He looks pained for a moment.]  In the end, we all just play the roles given us...sometimes they don't fit so well, but I guess we make do...}{}{3}{}{}
{9}{You and I know a lot about that it seems...}{}{5}{}{11}{}
{11}{Yes...I'd never had thought myself worthy of this affair.  And I shouldn't be making judgments about anyone's character.  I think I'd best just keep my bloody mouth shut...}{Yes...I'd never had thought myself worthy of this affair.  And I shouldn't be making judgments about anyone's character.  I think I'd best just keep my bloody mouth shut...}{}{4}{}{}
{12}{Virgil...}{}{5}{}{14}{}
{14}{Listen...[He struggles with the words.]  There's...something that happened to me...well, because of me...because I was foolish, because I was a coward.  Burdens like mine...they don't go away...they always come back to...to...collect what is due them.  Someday, the balance will have to be paid...}{Listen...[He struggles with the words.]  There's...something that happened to me...well, because of me...because I was foolish, because I was a coward.  Burdens like mine...they don't go away...they always come back to...to...collect what is due them.  Someday, the balance will have to be paid...}{}{5}{}{}
{15}{What are you talking about?}{}{5}{}{17}{}
{17}{No...I shouldn't have said anything about it.  As I've said...the past is in the past.}{No...I shouldn't have said anything about it.  As I've said...the past is in the past.}{}{6}{}{}
{18}{Well, what do you think we should do now?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{20}{[He seems a bit worried.]  I don't know.  I was hoping that Joachim would be here to give us a little guidance.  It seems we've been running blind without the reins, doesn't it?  [He shakes his head.]  I guess we should just stick to the task at hand...}{[He seems a bit worried.]  I don't know.  I was hoping that Joachim would be here to give us a little guidance.  It seems we've been running blind without the reins, doesn't it?  [He shakes his head.]  I guess we should just stick to the task at hand...}{}{7}{}{gf2310 1}
{21}{Sounds good to me.  Let's get moving...}{}{5}{}{}{fl 23}
{23}{Yes...the day's not getting any younger...}{Yes...the day's not getting any younger...}{}{8}{}{}
{25}{[Virgil slowly shakes his head, chuckling softly.]  You're not a bad sort, but sometimes even a religious man's got his limits.  [He looks to the horizon.]  Well, my slow friend, it seems that Joachim has left us once again, and I've once again been given the responsibility of keeping you alive...}{[Virgil slowly shakes his head, chuckling softly.]  You're not a bad sort, but sometimes even a religious man's got his limits.  [He looks to the horizon.]  Well, my slow friend, it seems that Joachim has left us once again, and I've once again been given the responsibility of keeping you alive...}{}{9}{}{}
